/target
.DS_Store

# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored: this crate ships a binary
# (`aria-ai-cli`), and it pins `llama-cpp-2` exactly because that crate does not
# follow semver. A committed lockfile is what makes a build reproducible.

# `aria-ai-cli`'s default storage root. Holds downloaded model weights (GBs)
# and, more importantly, `insights.db` — real call transcripts and summaries.
# That must never be committable, even encrypted.
/.aria-ai/

# Model weights, wherever they land. Everything here is fetched from the
# catalogue and verified by digest; none of it belongs in git.
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.bin

# Insight databases and their WAL/shm siblings.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
